An '''Overclocker 3000''' is a {{Legendary}} item.

== Obtaining ==
An '''Overclocker 3000''' can be obtained across various activities in {{Zone|The Garden}}:
* Trading with [[Visitors]].
* Rewarded from [[Jacob's Farming Contests]].
* Dropped from [[Crops]].
* {{Green|0.05%}} ({{Green|1}} in {{Yellow|2,000}}) chance to be dropped from the [[Greenhouse]].
* Dropped from [[Pests]].

Each activity increases the chance for an '''Overclocker 3000''' to drop from it through the [[Pity]] system up to {{Green|100%}}.

Upon obtaining an '''Overclocker 3000''', the following message displays:
{{Dialogue|&6&lABOUT TIME! &eYou find an &6Overclocker 3000&e!}}

== Usage ==
An '''Overclocker 3000''' can be applied to any [[Farming Tool]] up to {{Green|10}} times to increase its level cap.

